{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-02T13:09:28.011Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6da2f5f4d31f8f762cde8c96","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1576","claim:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1576+pm-urzubi","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1576","claim:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-wsqxwb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"MCP annotation and linked-artifact tools silently read when add is passed at the top level: the strict schema declares add/text but dispatch only hoists ifAbsent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Measured on the feat/write-time-preconditions branch (2026.11.2 source). The strict action schema for comments, notes, learnings and files declares top-level add (and text for comments), so pm_comments {id, add: \"x\"} validates. The dispatcher's HOISTED_ACTION_OPTION_KEYS hoists only ifAbsent for the annotation actions and nothing for files, so the top-level add never reaches the command. The call becomes a listing read and returns success with count 0. The agent believes it recorded evidence. Only options.add works. Found when pm-gh1576's expected-revision receipt reported expect_hash_unchecked for a comments call that was meant to write. Same class as pm-upi0 (nested unknown keys no-op) and pm-yp56 (comment invocation recording nothing exited 0), but on DECLARED top-level keys, so no unknown-key warning fires."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","annotations","area:mcp","schema-dispatch-parity","silent-no-op"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-02T13:09:28.011Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-02T13:09:28.011Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Every top-level parameter the strict MCP/SDK action schema declares for comments, notes, learnings, files and docs is either hoisted into the command options or removed from the schema, proven by a parity test that iterates the schema-declared keys rather than a hand list; A pm_comments/pm_files call with top-level add writes the entry (or refuses), never returns a listing; Regression test drives the MCP handleRequest path for each annotation action"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-5k4v"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A declared top-level add on an annotation or linked-artifact MCP tool writes the entry, exactly like options.add"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"pm_comments {id, add} and pm_files {id, add} return a successful listing with count 0 and write nothing"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gh1576","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-02T13:09:28.011Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-upi0","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-02T13:09:28.011Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-yp56","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-02T13:09:28.011Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"d1bd2f0dd0efa5d5173b28633b5ff025f5ab6c0fb2f4b7a5063dcf22d9229abf","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"86251102a993557795de340578ef536ef46c59434f729b444aa835569330c0dc"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-02T14:54:02.256Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6da2f5f4d31f8f762cde8c96","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-02T14:54:02.256Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-02T14:54:02.256Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Scope evidence from the pm-gh1576 Codex fix round: the same declared-but-not-hoisted class also hits history-redact. pmToolActionParameterKeys(\"history-redact\") declares top-level literal, regex and replacement, but runAction only reads them from options, so {id, literal: [...]} refuses with 'history-redact requires at least one literal' (loud, not silent). The parity test this item's AC asks for should iterate every action's schema-declared keys, not only the annotation and linked-artifact actions."}]}],"before_hash":"d1bd2f0dd0efa5d5173b28633b5ff025f5ab6c0fb2f4b7a5063dcf22d9229abf","after_hash":"30c451b32a32360cabcf61b40c2d25bdb90952fdaec6435acd9abecb6c8ae3a0","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"84dfc347496b25ea9c20160c1b3958e2b648e5c0bf495978847c34919b3e3a59"}
