{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-08T00:38:55.671Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"5d97cc75851de74b9275ff63","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-8s53lj","claim:pm-hka7ep","claim:pm-wsqxwb","lineage:pm-wsqxwb","lineage:pm-5k4v","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-8s53lj+pm-hka7ep+pm-wsqxwb","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-8s53lj","claim:pm-hka7ep","claim:pm-wsqxwb","lineage:pm-wsqxwb","lineage:pm-5k4v","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"close","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Through the MCP tools/call handler on a sandbox tracker, pm_comments, pm_notes and pm_learnings with a top-level add or text now write the entry, and pm_files, pm_docs and pm_test with a top-level add link it. Before the fix each returned an empty listing and wrote nothing. The text plus add conflict is refused with exit 2. tests/unit/mcp/annotation-tool-flat-parameters.spec.ts iterates every schema-declared optional key of the six actions and drives tools/call for each. It reads the written state back through the CLI and guards an MCP edit with a flat expectAt. The linked tests pass through pm test --run."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A pm_comments, pm_notes, pm_learnings, pm_files, pm_docs or pm_test call with a top-level add (or annotation text) writes the entry or refuses, and never returns a listing"},{"op":"remove","path":"/metadata/claim_principal"},{"op":"remove","path":"/metadata/assignee"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-08T00:38:55.671Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/status","value":"closed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/closed_at","value":"2026-11-08T00:38:55.639Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/completed_at","value":"2026-11-08T00:38:55.639Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/resolution","value":"runtime-input.ts now derives flat-to-options hoisting for comments, notes, learnings, files, docs and test from PM_TOOL_ACTION_PARAMETER_CONTRACTS, as for the read actions. Operands (id, text, query, keywords) are excluded, and nested options still win. foldAnnotationTextOperand binds the annotation text operand, flat or nested, to add, the way the CLI binds positional text. Disagreeing text and add values are refused with annotation_text_source_conflict before any write. MCP option-conformance docs describe the rule. Remaining silent drops in other action families, such as pm_history with a flat limit, are owned by pm-yjjo4l."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"Fixed: MCP annotation, linked-artifact and linked-test tools write when add or text is passed at the top level"}],"before_hash":"e9c6fa7afeff2ab695cc6e57e5694ae4ea213b27603ea4240e572cbf510b9599","after_hash":"49262a5349a0369c6a455c214c7f907b400dce67ed4d4612b62c780cbd55973b","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-08T00:38:55.639Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"0edb7411c0aa3fa2464def20bfb5da46434f3865a831a4a09545d261e4433956"}
